From: Announce <announce@corp.example>
To: undisclosed-recipients:;
Cc: Engineering: alice@corp.example, bob@corp.example, carol@corp.example;
Subject: Group address syntax
Date: Tue, 11 Aug 2026 13:20:00 +0000
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=utf-8

The To: header uses RFC 5322 group syntax with no members.
The Cc: header uses a named group with three members.
Neither may render as "undefined <undefined>".
